        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sang'weli ataalī kūbahūba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Sang'weli ūbawīla a Baisilaeli, “Ū nene naang'wigwile ūmo ng'wahayīlile, nīīta gīt'ūmo mukaniwīlīla, nūūmupandīkīla ū ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī haha mulī nang'hwe ū ntemi wa kūmutongeela. Alīyo ū nene mulīnibona ūmo naanamhalūkīlile, neelile pe ū mu ntwe; na a baana bane balī hamò ning'we aha. Jakwīlaga ī shikū nakūmutongeelaga ū nene; nguno īlī kūfuma ha būsūmba wane kūshisha lelo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī haha ūūyū nīmīīlaga aha; nikaanīlījagi kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA na ng'witīīlwa wakwe wa maguta. Naasola ng'ombe ya ng'wa nani? Nūūlū nzobe ya ng'wa nani? Nani ūyo naanyeekeja shose shose? Nūūlū halī aho munhū ose ose ūyo naang'wiboneela? Nanukūla būhongwa wa kūnibbokuja miso gane kūfuma kūlī nani? Ūlū nīīta mhayo nūūlū gūmò ū mu yenīyī nakūgūgoloola.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnshokeja būhaya, “Ūtaalī kūtūnyeekeja nūūlū kūtwiboneela; ūtaalī kūsola shikolo shose shose kūfuma mu nkono go ng'wa munhū nūūlū ūmò.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ū Sang'weli ūbawīla, “Ū SEEBA nkaanīji wing'we, nū ng'witīīlwa wakwe wa maguta wamukaanīla ī lelo yenīyī, ūmo ng'wahayīla gīkī mutaalī kūbona shilingo kūfuma mu nkono gwane.” Būhaya, “Na ng'hana alī nkaanīji wise.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūbizūkīja ya kūng'wigwa SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Sang'weli wandya kūbizūkīja a banhū; ūbawīla, Ū SEEBA hū ng'wene ūyo akabasola ba Musa na Alooni, būbīnja a bakūlūgenji bing'we ū mu sī ya Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī haha īmīīlagi mulembeele nang'wizūkīje kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA, ī shītīle shakwe ī sha būtūngīlīja īsho wang'wītīla a bing'we na a bakūlūgenji bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yakobo akasaamīla Misili, a bakūlūgenji bingwe būnīlīīla ū SEEBA gīkī abagunanhe, ū SEEBA ūbatūma a ba Musa nū Alooni kūbafunya a bakūlūgenji bing'we ū mu sī ya Misili, biza būbatūūla ū ng'wipandī īlī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo būng'wība ū SEEBA Mulungu wabo, na lūūlū ūbajinja mu nkono go ng'wa Sisela, ūyo walī ntaale wa mabità ga ng'wa Hazooli, na mu makono ga Bafilisiti, na ga ntemi wa Moabu, ūlwa nabo būlūgū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Būnīlīīla hangī ū SEEBA balīhaya, “Twahūbile nguno twanekile ū SEEBA twandya kūtūmamīla Maabaalī na Maashitoleti, alīyo ī haha tūlīkūlomba ūtūpīje ū mu makono ga banishi bise, tūkūkūtūmamīla bebe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū SEEBA ūmutūmīla ba Yelubaa,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Yelubaa:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ūyo akitanagwa Gidioni.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Balaaka,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12:11",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Balaaka:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Shandīkwa shingī shikang'hayaga Bedani.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yefuta na Sang'weli; ū mu nzīla yenīyo ūng'wīnja ū mu makono ga banishi bing'we hose hose, ng'ūbiza mu mhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo aho ng'wamona ū ntemi Nahashi wa Baamoni aliza kūng'ūūbūkīla gīkī alwe ning'we būlūgū, ng'ūniwīla, “Yaya lūūlū ī gete tūpandīke ntemi wa kūtūsuga; nūūlū īkī ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we hū ng'wene ū Ntemi wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alilūūlū, ī haha ūūyū ū ntemi ūyo ng'walūng'wigongejaga, ūyo ng'walombile kwinhwa; mulībona gīkī ū SEEBA wamutūūlīlaga ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'ūng'ogoha ū SEEBA ng'ūntūmamīla na kūng'wigwa we, ng'ūleka ū kūshigomela ī shilagīlo shakwe; nīyo ūlū gīkī a bing'we nū ntemi wing'we ūyo alīmusuga mukūnondeela ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, īkūbeelela no! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ng'ūlema ū kūng'wigwa ū SEEBA, ng'ūshigomela nī shilagīlo shakwe, a henaho ū nkono gwakwe gūkwilwisha ning'we, gīt'ūmo gwilwisījaga na a bakūlūgenji bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ī haha lembeelagi gete ūmo ng'wīmīīlīlaga gīko, mugūbone ū mhayo ū ntaale ūyo SEEBA alīhaya kūgwīta kū būtongi wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza īlī lītī lya kūgesa ngano? Nanombe ū SEEBA ī haha wenhe mbula ya kūpalalūka. Hū mukūbūdeeba ū būbi ūbo ng'wawītile ū kūlī SEEBA ū mu kūlomba ng'winhwe ntemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Sang'weli ūnomba ū SEEBA, na ng'hana lūshikū lwenūlo dūhū ū SEEBA wenha mbula ya kūpalalūka. Na lūūlū a banhū būng'ogoha noi ū SEEBA nū Sang'weli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū būng'wīla gīkī ū Sang'weli, “Balombelage a batūmami bako ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wako tūtizūūcha, nguno a higūlya ya būkenaagūji wise ūbo tūlī nabo kūfuma kale, tongelelegije ho nū wa kūlomba kwinhwa ntemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Sang'weli ūbawīla, “Mutogohage na ng'hana ng'wītile ī yabūbi ī yose yenīyī; gwike ilang'hanagi mutizūgalūka mukaneka ū SEEBA. Alīyo ntūmamīlagi SEEBA na ng'holò jing'we jose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūgagalūkīla hangī a maashiikolile ayo gatī na ngofyoolo nūūlū hado. A genayo gatūmugunanha mhayo gose gose, gatūdūla nūūlū kūmupīja; nguno gatī na shose shose nūūlū hado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo īkī ū SEEBA akayega kūng'wīta a bing'we kūbiza bakwe, ū wei atīko ū kūbaleka a banhū bakwe, nguno ī lina lyakwe līl'itaale no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama nūūlū ū nene ū kūleka ū kūmulombela, nose nang'hūbe ū SEEBA, gwene gūlī ngilo gete; nīyo nakūmulanga nī nzīla ī yawiza īyo ītūngīlīgije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike īng'wigeleelilwe kūng'ogoha ū SEEBA na kūntūmamīla mu wishigwa na ng'holò jing'we jose. Yizūkagwi ī mitaale mitaale īyo wang'wītīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ng'wikale mukwītaga yabūbi, mukūkenaagūlwa pyī nū ntemi wing'we.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
